{"id":"252601","name":"桂花豆馅","author":"li1943","authorId":"1479543","desc":"","cover":"images/252601/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红小豆","amount":"500克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干桂花","amount":"10克"}],"sub":[{"name":"花生油","amount":"150克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"3-5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红小豆洗净","img":"images/252601/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放水1500--2000克","img":"images/252601/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入电饭煲煮至水干豆烂","img":"images/252601/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用饭勺碾煮好的豆子","img":"images/252601/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"碾成泥状的豆沙","img":"images/252601/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅凉油放入油（放大油更香）","img":"images/252601/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入白糖","img":"images/252601/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"换文火继续炒制","img":"images/252601/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"糖完全融化微黄","img":"images/252601/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入豆沙翻炒","img":"images/252601/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再放盐少许和干桂花继续翻炒","img":"images/252601/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"一直炒到筷子可以立住豆馅就完成了","img":"images/252601/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"各种点心可用","img":"images/252601/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"蒸馅馒头又大又香","img":"images/252601/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"炒糖的时候要不停的翻炒以免糊锅底。一定要用文火，火不能大。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}